From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Center the Quick controls button on the cover

The cover's 339dp width picks Camera's sw338dp sizes for the Quick controls
button and its round background, but that set leaves out the button's end
margin, so it fell back to sw329dp's 8dp and the icon sat 17 px left of its
background. The sw338dp sizes only line up with no margin, so set it to 0.

diff --git a/res/values-sw338dp-xxxhdpi/dimens.xml b/res/values-sw338dp-xxxhdpi/dimens.xml
--- a/res/values-sw338dp-xxxhdpi/dimens.xml
+++ b/res/values-sw338dp-xxxhdpi/dimens.xml
@@ -841,6 +841,7 @@
     <dimen name="quick_setting_entry_bg_right_margin">7.5dp</dimen>
     <dimen name="quick_setting_entry_bg_width">30.0dp</dimen>
     <dimen name="quick_setting_entry_button_size">45.099976dp</dimen>
+    <dimen name="quick_setting_entry_button_right_margin">0.0dp</dimen>
     <dimen name="quick_setting_height">56.299988dp</dimen>
     <dimen name="quick_setting_indicator_disable_partial_blur_background_radius">7.5dp</dimen>
     <dimen name="quick_setting_indicator_divider_item_image_width">13.099976dp</dimen>
